  "summary": [
    "Historical anchor: 2/3 majority has occurred in four of nine post-1990 elections, anchoring the probability near 0.44.",
    "Opposition consolidation around the Tisza platform and potential entry of Our Homeland increase uncertainty and create upside risk for challenges to a 2/3 majority.",
