  "confidence": "medium",
  "narrative": "The 2026 race is highly contested. Opposition consolidation around Tisza and the possible inclusion of Our Homeland could threaten a 2/3 outcome, but structural advantages for Fidesz and divergent polls keep the probability modest and uncertain, centered in the low-40s.",
