    "anchor": {
      "probability": 0.44,
      "basis": "Post-1990 Hungarian parliamentary elections show 2/3 majorities (133+ seats) four times out of nine; this yields a baseline anchor near 0.44 for the likelihood of a 2/3 outcome in 2026."
